# Standalone Postgres backend — copy to `.env` and fill in to share data
# across every signed-in tester instead of keeping it in one browser.
#
# Leave unset to run fully local: data stays in this browser's localStorage
# and the dev-only demo login applies (npm run dev only — see server/README.md
# and src/store/useAuthStore.ts for why that credential doesn't exist in a
# production build).
#
# Start the backend first: `docker compose up -d` from the repo root (see
# docker-compose.yml and server/README.md), then point the app at it here.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
